{"info":{"id":"ses_e64ce6ee9ffegcUrw06hsbcFpg","projectID":"b3649b6a7bbc86068e3c350b4d991d29317961a9","model":{"id":"fusion","providerID":"copilot-fusion-direct","variant":"default"},"cost":0,"tokens":{"input":1372,"output":414,"reasoning":456,"cache":{"read":23151,"write":2597}},"outcome":"succeeded","time":{"created":1793605079797,"updated":1793605108190,"busy":1793605081278,"idle":1793605108194},"title":"Infinite Realms GDD","location":{"directory":"/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround"}},"messages":[{"id":"msg_19b31930300177oHvRUgc3osDL","time":{"created":1793605081296},"text":"\"PROJECT: INFINITE REALMS - MASTER GAME DESIGN DOCUMENT (GDD)\n​1. PROJECT OVERVIEW @COMMENT_BODY@ CORE LOOP\n​Game Title: Infinite Realms: Open-World Action RPG\n​Platforms: PC (Keyboard/Mouse + Gamepad), Mobile (Touch Controls), Cross-Play Enabled.\n​Core Loop:\n​Explore the open world and combat monsters.\n​Earn XP, level up infinitely, and allocate Stat / Skill points via the level-up popup.\n​Collect randomized, class-matched loot across 7 rarity tiers.\n​Reach Level 99,999,999 to unlock the \\infty (Infinity) milestone.\n​Enter the global cross-play online PvP arena.\n​2. CROSS-PLATFORM INPUT @COMMENT_BODY@ CONTROLS COMMAND CONFIG\n​🕹️ Unified Control Mapping\n​Movement: PC (W, A, S, D) | Mobile (Virtual Joystick) | Controller (Left Analog Stick)\n​Camera / Aim: PC (Mouse Drag) | Mobile (Right-Screen Swipe) | Controller (Right Analog Stick)\n​Basic Attack: PC (Left Click) | Mobile (Primary Attack Button) | Controller (RT / R2)\n​Class Skills (1–4): PC (1, 2, 3, 4) | Mobile (Arc Cluster Buttons) | Controller (A, B, X, Y / Cross, Circle, Square, Triangle)\n​Dodge / Dash: PC (Spacebar) | Mobile (Dodge Button) | Controller (LB / L1 or LT / L2)\n​Target Lock-On: PC (Middle Click) | Mobile (Lock-On Icon) | Controller (Right Stick Click / R3)\n​3. CHARACTER CLASSES @COMMENT_BODY@ ADVANCED SKILL TREES\n​Each class features a branching active/passive skill tree unlocked using the 5 skill points gained per level-up.\n​⚔️ Class 1: Swordsman (Melee Tank / Bruiser)\n​Playstyle: High health pool, armor mitigation, and close-quarters AoE wave clearing.\n​Skill Tree Branches:\n​Juggernaut Path: Increases maximum HP and armor. Unlocks passive Thorns (reflects physical damage back to attackers).\n​Blade Master Path: Increases critical strike chance and attack speed. Unlocks active skill Whirlwind Slash (continuous 360-degree close-range damage).\n​Unyielding Wall Path: Unlocks active block/counter-window mechanics. Perfect timing reduces incoming damage to 0 and triggers a massive counter-strike.\n​🧙‍♂️ Class 2: Wizard (Ranged AoE / Elemental Mage)\n​Playstyle: High intelligence scaling, crowd control, and devastating elemental area destruction.\n​Skill Tree Branches:\n​Pyromancer Path: Focuses on burn damage over time (DoT) and explosive fireballs that splash targets.\n​Cryomancer Path: Focuses on freezing enemies in place, slowing group movement speed, and adding defensive ice armor.\n​Arcane Mastery Path: Reduces skill cooldowns and increases maximum Mana/Energy regeneration, allowing rapid spell-casting loops.\n​🥷 Class 3: Ninja (Agility Assassin / Critical Specialist)\n​Playstyle: Ultra-high mobility dashes, stealth concealment, and massive single-target critical multipliers.\n​Skill Tree Branches:\n​Shadow Strike Path: Increases movement speed and dodge chance. Unlocks instant teleportation behind the highest-threat target.\n​Phantom Clone Path: Unlocks active skill Shadow Clones (creates decoy clones that replicate player sword strikes).\n​Venom Blade Path: Applies lethal poison stacking effects on critical hits, melting high-health monster armor over time.\n​🏹 Archer (Ranged Precision / Kiting Specialist)\n​Playstyle: Continuous movement attack loops, crowd trap deployment, and long-range armor-piercing shots.\n​Skill Tree Branches:\n​Sniper Path: Increases critical damage range and arrow projectile velocity. Unlocks Piercing Shot (passes through multiple monsters).\n​Trapper Path: Unlocks proximity snare traps and explosive mines to manage crowd movement in open terrain.\n​Storm Ranger Path: Increases attack speed exponentially with consecutive hits. Unlocks Multi-Shot Volley (fires an arc of 5 arrows simultaneously).\n​4. INFINITE LEVELING @COMMENT_BODY@ SCALING EQUATIONS Level Progression: Starts at Level 1 for both player and environment monsters. Monsters scale dynamically using the exponential scaling equation:\n\"","files":[],"type":"user"},{"id":"msg_19b3198ea001ERtVYfa4UfAYqP","time":{"created":1793605081329,"streamed":1793605084137,"completed":1793605099894},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"fusion","providerID":"copilot-fusion-direct","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"","native":{"itemId":"","reasoningEncryptedContent":""},"time":{"created":1793605083714,"completed":1793605083718}},{"type":"tool","id":"call_O6Ae4Zc4NTCKfvdZ1vFOOoto","name":"subagent","executed":false,"native":{"itemId":""},"state":{"status":"completed","input":{"agent":"explore","description":"Inspect project files","prompt":"Quickly inspect the repository structure and summarize what this project is, notable entry points, and whether there is an existing game/design implementation related to the user's pasted Infinite Realms GDD. Do not modify files.","background":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<subagent sessionID=\"ses_e64ce5c1affeHacnTbbMXbpPBK\" state=\"completed\">\n## Repository summary\n\nThis is a very small OMGithub-created project scaffold, not an implemented game. The README describes it as a place to build/remix projects but contains no game-specific overview or design documentation.\n\n## Notable entry points\n\n- [`/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/README.md`](/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/README.md) — project landing page with OMGithub and GitHub links.\n- [`/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/start.sh`](/home/runner/work/PlayGround/PlayGround/sta