n2: \n3: - Run long-lived servers and watchers in a persistent session such as tmux.\n4: - Do not background them in bounded commands without explicit detachment and cleanup.\n5: - After a timeout, inspect the process and endpoint before retrying or claiming failure.\n6: \n7: ## Linux browser and WebGPU capture\n8: \n9: - Use the preinstalled `playwright-cli` executable from Actions or SSH.\n10: - Use its headed Chromium, persistent Xvfb display, and SwiftShader configuration.\n11: - Run `playwright-cli open http://localhost:3002` for the Pascal development server.\n12: - Load a saved scene. Wait for actual geometry and the active WebGPU renderer.\n13: - Run `playwright-cli screenshot --filename=screenshots/linux.png` after creating the output directory.\n14: - Inspect the image. Reject loading screens, empty grids, and blank canvases.\n15: - Report SwiftShader as CPU software rendering. Do not claim GPU hardware acceleration.\n16: - Inspect `$HOME/.local/share/omgithub-playwright/linux.json` for launch settings.\n17: - Use `playwright-cli --help` for commands and named sessions. Pass configuration only to `open`."}],"metadata":{"truncated":false}},"time":{"created":1793605105129,"ran":1793605105137,"completed":1793605105146}}],"snapshot":{"start":"9e70c5a7f1191959c327c7751b0ba976fc417e27","end":"9e70c5a7f1191959c327c7751b0ba976fc417e27","files":[]},"finish":"tool-calls","native":{"responseId":"","serviceTier":"default"},"cost":0,"tokens":{"input":3,"output":68,"reasoning":61,"cache":{"read":6250,"write":250}}},{"id":"msg_19b31f624001gskv0Qb7dAamMg","time":{"created":1793605105194,"streamed":1793605108180,"completed":1793605108190},"type":"assistant","agent":"build","model":{"id":"fusion","providerID":"copilot-fusion-direct","variant":"default"},"content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"","native":{"itemId":"","reasoningEncryptedContent":""},"time":{"created":1793605107436,"completed":1793605107438}},{"type":"text","text":"I see the *Infinite Realms* GDD, but there’s n